'''The Battle Cats Unite!''' (ふたりで！にゃんこ大戦争, ''Futari De！ Nyanko Daisensō'', '''Together! Nyanko Great War''') is the Nintendo Switch version of [[The Battle Cats]] which is developed by [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] and [https://www.tose.co.jp/en/ TOSE CO., Ltd.] As of December 15, 2025, The Battle Cats Unite! has accumulated 1.6 million sales worldwide<ref>https://www.ponos.jp/news/2025/12/nintendo-switch版『ふたりで！にゃんこ大戦争』全世界累/</ref>.

There exists three versions, that being the International (WW), Japanese (JP), and Southeast Asia (SEA) versions. The International version is currently on [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.3 Update/WW|Patch 1.0.3]], the Japanese version is on [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.9 Update|Patch 1.0.9]], and the Southeast Asia version is on [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|Patch 1.0.0]].

