==Blurb==
'''At long last, play The Battle Cats with friends! Team up with friends to take on the Doge Army! Show your friends the power of your Cat Army in versus!'''

Based off of the hit mobile game The Battle Cats, downloaded over 90 million times worldwide! Now available on Nintendo Switch™ with all-new features!

Featuring a simple-to-learn battle system that anyone can enjoy! Team up with a friend to increase the fun many times over! Play with family, friends, or even during a night in with that special someone! Create your own weirdly cute Cat Army and take to the battlefield!

★ The Battle Cats Unite! Nintendo Switch™ Features ★

◆Collect over 350 different weirdly cute Cat heroes!

Use Cat Food and Ticket items earned in game collect a variety of different Cats from the in-game Capsule machine and evolve them!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>This game contains no in-game purchases.

◆More stages, more fun!

Play over 300 stages, with some based off of the real world, the future, and even some set in space! Or embark a journey searching for legendary Cats in the Stories of Legend!

◆Take a break from battle with exciting minigames!

As you progress through the game, you'll sometimes be offered the lucky chance to play one of four minigames! Earn bonus items and Cat Energy based on your score!

★ Two-Player Features ★

◆Cooperate to command your Cats!

Play each stage alone or with a friend. Take command of five units each to team up and battle oncoming waves of enemies. Alone, the challenge may be too much, but together, nothing stands in your way!

◆Prepare to fire the Cat Cannon... together!

Work together with your partner to blast baddies with the Cat Cannon! With good timing, power up the Cat Cannon 200% and turn the tide of battle in your favor!

◆Battle a friend in a Cat Army clash!

It's Cat Army vs. Cat Army in VS Mode! Use the VS Mode-specific Trait Cannon to strike at the weakness in your opponent's forces! You'll have to know each and every Cat to claim victory!

==Features==
{{LongSection|text=
*Save 「セーブ」: Just like [[The Battle Cats POP!]], The Battle Cats Unite! includes a manual save functionality which can be used anytime in the main menu.
*Play Together! 「協力プレイ でいげ 出陣」: Two players go into battle with 5 cats each, both players also have their own wallets that be upgraded and cannon that can be used. It can be unlocked once clearing [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia]] in the [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter.
**The players can receive a rank based on how well they do in the level via points earned.
***The following ranks can be obtained based on total points earned:
****Legend
****Rank S
****Rank A
****Rank B
****Rank C
**When the [[Cat Cannon]] is used, a quick time event will happen with the message shown "Press Together!", if successful the Cat Cannon will release a large rainbow beam, then a [[Wave Attack|Super Shockwave]] (放イ!超にゃんこ砲) across the battlefield. If unsuccessful, it will be replaced with a regular Cat Cannon Wave Attack.
**A taglines can be received depending on both the players' score when beating a stage.
***Team grade taglines for Legend ranks:
****Tag Masters Nya!
****Bros in Arms Nya!
**** Filial Piety Nya!
**** Plagued Kingdom Nya!
***Team grade taglines for Rank S:
****Purr-fect Nya!
****Master and Disciple Nya!
****Genius and Fool Nya!
**** Wielding Power Nya!
***Team grade taglines for Rank A:
****Eager to Pounce Nya!
****Boss and Minion Nya!
****President's Pet Nya!
****Apples & Oranges Nya!
***Team grade taglines for Rank B:
****Good(?) Teamwork Nya!
****Unfunny Jokers Nya!
****Helicopter Parent Nya!
****Piggyback Nya!
***Team grade taglines for Rank C:
****Team Too Bad Nya!
****Burnouts Nya!
****Calamity Nya!
****Just Acquaintances Nya!
*Earn a login bonus every 6 hours! 「6時間毎にもらえる、ログインポーナス！」: Every 6 hours the game is not being played, you will gain a login bonus, the bonuses range from:
**1 [[Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]]
**50 [[Cat Food]]
*Randomizing Formation 「ランダム」: As well as the default ten lineups the player can use, an eleventh is introduced that completely randomized your lineup with the units you currently unlocked. But you are not allowed to choose what units you would like to keep, text saying "Formation will appear after entering battle." (戦闘開始時に自動で編成されます。) appears where the units description would be.
*Mini-games 「オリジナルミニゲーム」: Mini-games have a set chance to appear after clearing or losing a stage, the Cat's [[Splash Text]] will appear saying, "Take on a Mini-game!" (にゃんにゃんチャンス！ミニゲームで一息つくにゃ！) One or two players are able to play minigames together, which can be unlocked when clearing [[Australia (Empire of Cats)|Australia]] (高知県, '''Kochi''' in the Japanese version) there are four minigames in total:
<tabber>
Sniper the Cat Alley=
「Sniper the Cat Alley」 (ぶっとびランチャー, ''Buttobi Ranchā'', '''Buttobi Launcher''')<br>
This minigame includes a [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] with a cannon on-top of its head and a [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] that will move back and forth, every time the a button is pressed it will shoot a bullet.<br>
Your goal here is to defend your area from a mass release of [[Doge]]s, [[Metal Doge]]s and [[Doge Dark]]s, if unsuccessful to defend your area you will lose 1 second out of the 30 you start with.
*If hit with the cannon:
**Doge gives 100 points.
**Metal Doge gives 20 then 30 then 300 points.
**Doge Dark gives 20 then 30 then 500 points.
*If hit by Tank Cat:
**Doge gives 30 points.
**Metal Doge gives 70 points.
**Doge Dark gives 100 points.
*This minigame is able to give a various number of rewards depending on your score:
**18,000 points will give 5 items.
**12,000 points will give 3 items.
**5,000 points will give 2 items.
**Participating will give 1 item.
|-|
Whack-A-Doge=
「Whack-A-Doge」 (わんこでポン, ''Wanko de Pon'', '''Pon With A Dog''')
This minigame includes [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Viking Cat]] standing atop a large whack a mole and a [[Ototo Corps|Thunderbolt Cannon]] in the distance.<br>
Your goal here is hit as many enemies that appear from the holes.
*If hit with Viking Cat:
**Doge gives 100 points.
**[[Ginger Snache|Ginger snache]] give 200 points.
**[[Assassin Bear]] give 500 points.
*If hit by the Thunderbolt Cannon the enemy will be frozen in place for a short period of time allowing you to hit the enemy before it disappears, additionally it will double the score of the hit enemy.
*This minigame is able to give a various number of rewards depending on your score:
**13,000 points will give 5 items.
**7,000 points will give 3 items.
**4,000 points will give 2 items.
**Participating will give 1 item.
|-|
Meow Meow Relay=
「Meow Meow Relay」 (ネコネコダッシュ, ''Nekonekodasshu'', '''Cat Cat Dash''')<br>
This minigame includes Cat, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Lizard Cat]], [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]], [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] and finally [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]] that will be used to dash across a mat avoiding obstacles such as [[:Category:Enemy Units|Enemies]] and red spikes while collecting coins and interacting with a [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] after a certain distance has been run, such like the Olympic sport Baton Pass.<br>
Your goal here is to avoid all obstacles while collecting as many coins as possible.
*If a coin is collected it will grant 100 points.
*If dashing over a dash panel you will dash faster.
*If hit by an enemy you will be stopped for a while before proceeding to dash again.
*This minigame is able to give a various number of rewards depending on your score:
**14,000 points will give 5 items.
**8,000 points will give 3 items.
**4,000 points will give 2 items.
**Participating will give 1 item.
|-|
Li'l Cat Catcher=
「Li'l Cat Catcher」 (ネコつかみ大作戦, ''Neko Tsukami Dai Sakusen'', '''Operation Cat Grab''')<br>
This minigame includes Cat and Tank Cat catching [[Li'l Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Cat]], [[Li'l Axe Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Axe Cat]], [[Li'l Cow Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Cow Cat]], a [[Gold Cat (Super Rare Cat)|golden]] version of Li'l Cat while avoiding dumbbells falling from the top of the screen.
*Li'l Cat gives 100 points.
*Li'l Axe Cat give 200 points.
*Li'l Cow Cat give 200 points.
*Golden Li'l Cat give 500 points.
*If hit by a falling dumbbell, you will be stopped for a while before being able to move again.
*This minigame is able to give a various number of rewards depending on your score:
**15,000 points will give 5 items.
**8,000 points will give 3 items.
**4,000 points will give 2 items.
**Participating will give 1 item.
</tabber>
*The following items can be rewarded to the player as well as probability of obtaining said item:
**[[Battle Items]] have a 20% chance of being rewarded to the player.
***16% chance to get Speed Up.
***16% chance to get Treasure Radar.
***16% chance to get Rich Cat.
***16% chance to get Cat CPU.
***16& chance to get Cat Jobs.
***16% chance to get Sniper the Cat.
**[[Cat Capsule|Cat Tickets]] have a 40% chance of being rewarded to the player.
**[[Cat Capsule#Rare Gacha|Rare Tickets]] have a 20% chance of being rewarded to the player.
**[[XP Function|XP+100,000]] have a 20% chance of being rewarded to the player.
The player is also granted with a 30% increase to the energy allowing the player to play for longer.
*Additionally, once [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]] has been completed on all 3 star difficulty, the player is able to play the minigames at any time they want.
*Versus 「対戦モード」: This game mode is unlocked once clearing [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia]] in the [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter. There are two modes to versus, Single-Screen (おすそわけ), where two players share the same Switch but require two different controllers to play and Local Play (ローカル通信), where players are able to play on different Switch consoles in a local area. For more information, click ''[[The Battle Cats Unite!/Versus Mode|here]]''.
}}

